_frank.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251024195107 \"Possibly frank.jpg (921 KB","line":94}],"metadata":{"source":"https://snicket.fandom.com/wiki/Frank_Denouement","author":["[[Contributors to Lemony Snicket Wiki]]"],"published":null,"created":"2026-04-14"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"- Fandom, Inc. - Frank Denouement.md"},
